{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0855.1", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Λινέρος οὕτως ἔσθαι οὔτε οἱ φατὸς εὐει-δοὺς φωτὸς εὐήθους ὁ κελῶν πατρὶ πλαστὸς πλαστὸς ὡς εἶην πατρὶ ἄρτων τρεῖς ὄνους κανθη-λίους ἄρτους τρεῖς ὄνου κανθηλίου τρίς τῆς τῆς δὲ πίνει θ’ ἕμα πίνει δ’ ἕνα δὲ κασποφόρον ἐργάζεται δὲ φλαῦρα ἕλαφρά πως δήμους θερίζων δήμον θε-ρίζων ἕνα, μιξ δ’ ἐν ἡμέρα δαίνυσί τ’ ἕμπης εὖ καὶ πεχόρτασεν ἕτα κάπεχόρτασεν ἥ καὶ κάπεχόρτασεν εὖ καλῶς τ’ ἕχόρτασεν ἕπειτ’ ἄγων εἰς λῆα ταφρευμάτων <τ’> ἁρημένη ἄρπη ἄδρῶ γκυλίσας αὐτῷ γκυλίσας"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0855.2", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "θανὼν μὲν οὖν Μαίανδρον ἔρριψῃ ποδὸς"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0855.3", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "σόλος τις ὥσπερ· ἦν δ’ ὁ δισκεύσας ἄνὴρ"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0855.4", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "πυθιο· τίς γὰρ ἄνθ’ Ἑρακλέους;"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0855.5", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Anonymus in Westerm. Mythogr. haec subicit p. 347, 9: ὅτι δ’ ἀπέθανεν ὑφ’ Ἑρακλέους φησὶ λέγων ‘θανὼν — Ἑρακλέους’. v. 1 οὖν] εἰς Eichstaedt. v. 2 σοφὸς τις ὥσπερ δίσκος cod., σόλος τις ὥσπερ Casaubonus, ὥσπερ σόλος τις Hermann. v. 3 πυθιο...] fortasse Τυφόνδιος  legendum."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0855.6", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "οὐς ἡ Κλεάνθους μαρία βοηλατεῖ"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0855.7", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Laert. Diog. 7, 173: Σωσιθέου τοῦ ποιητοῦ ἐν θεάτρῳ εἰπόντος πρὸς αὐτὸν (Cleanthem) παρόντα ‘οὐς — βοηλατεῖ’ ἕμεινεν ἐπὶ τοῦ αὐτοῦ σχήματος· ἕφ’ ὃ ἀγασθέντες οἱ ἀκροαταὶ τὸν μὲν ἐκρότησαν,"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0856.1", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "τὸν δὲ Σωσίθεον ἐξέβαλον. μεταγινώσκοντα δὲ αὐτὸν ἐπὶ τῇ λοιδορίᾳ προσήκατο, εἰπὸν ἄτοπον εἶναι τὸν μὲν Λιόνυσον καὶ τὸν Ἡρακλέα φιλαγορουμενους ὑπὸ τῶν ποιητῶν μὴ ὀργίζεσθαι, αὐτὸν δὲ ἐπὶ τῇ τυχοῦσῃ βλασφημίᾳ δυσχεραίνειν. cf. Hesychius Miles. 42 p. 32, 4 ed. Fl. versiculus depromptus est ex satyrica fabula. Sositheus aequalem philosophum in scena commemorans non audacior fuit quam qui Menedemum scripsit Lycophron."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0856.2", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Eratosth. Catast. 28: ὧν (int. Τοξότην sive Κρότον τὸν Εὐφήμης τῆς τῶν μουσῶν τροφοῦ υἱόν) καὶ αἱ μοῦσαι τὴν τοξείαν εὐθάμενον τὴν τροφὴν ἀπὸ τῶν ἀγρίων ἔχειν ἐποίησαν, καθάπερ φησὶ Σωσίθεος. cf. Hygin. Poet. astr. 2, 27 p. 479 et Schol. German. Caes. Arat. p. 90, 4 et p. 159, 1."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0856.3", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ΑΔΩΝΙΣ"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0856.4", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Schol. Ar. Thesm. 1059: ἐπεὶ εἰσήγαγε κακοστένακτον τὴν Ἥχὼ ὁ Εὐριπίδης ἐν τῇ Ἀνδρομέδᾳ, εἰς τοῦτο παίζει. ἐξῆλῳσε δὲ αὐτὸν Πτολεμαῖος ὁ Φιλοπάτωρ ἐν ᾗ πεποίηκε τραγωδίᾳ Ἀδώνιδι, περὶ ἧς ὁ ἐρώμενος αὐτῷ Ἀγαθοκλῆς γέγραφε, ὁ ἀδελφὸς τῆς ἐρωμένης αὐτοῦ πάλιν Ἀγαθοκλείας."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0856.5", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ΑΜΦΙΤΡΩΝ"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0856.6", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "τίς δ' ἔστ' ἀνάγκη δυστυχεῖν ἐν πλείοσιν,"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0856.7", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ἔξον σιωπᾶν κἂν σκότῳ κρύπτειν τάδε;"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0856.8", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Ath. XIII p. 599 E: 'τίς δ' — τάδε;' Λισχύλος ἔφη ὁ Ἀλεξανδρεὺς ἐν Ἀμφιτρῶνι· οὗτος δ' ἐστὶν Λισχύλος ὁ καὶ τὰ Μεσσηνιακὰ ἔπη συνθεὶς, ἀνὴρ εὐπαιδεύτος. v. 1 τίς δ' ἔσται A."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0857.1", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "φεῦ φεῦ, γυναῖκες, ὡς ἐν ἀνθρώποις ἄρα"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0857.2", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "οὐ χρυσός, οὐ τυραννίς, οὐ πλοῦτον χλιδὴ"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0857.3", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "τοσοῦτον εἶχε διαφόρους τὰς ἡδονὰς"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0857.4", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ὡς ἀνδρὸς ἐσθλοῦ καὶ γυναικὸς εὐσεβοῦς"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0857.5", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "γνώμῃ δικαίᾳ καὶ φρονοῦσα τὰνδρικά."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0857.6", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Stob. Flor. 67, 3: Ἀπολλωνίδου. ‘φεῦ φεῦ — τὰνδρικά’. Clemens Alex. Paed. III p. 303: πάνυ γοῦν θαυμασίως ἡ τραγῳδία ‘φεῦ φεῦ, γυναῖκες’, φησίν, ‘ὡς ἐν ἀνθρώποις — φρονοῦσα τὰνδρικά’. v. 2 οὐ πλοῦτος, οὐ τυραννίς, οὐ χρυσοῦ χλιδὴ requiri arbitror. v. 3 εἶχεν Clem., ἔσχε coni. F. G. Schmidt Krit. Stud. 3 p. 25. v. 5 κοινὴ δίαυτα F. G. Schmidt Krit. Stud. 3 p. 27. τὰνδρικά Stob., τὰνδρικά Clem., ταῦτ’ ἀεὶ Herwerden Exerc. crit. p. 80, πάντ’ ἴσα Enger Adnot. ad poet. Gr. fr. p. 17."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0857.7", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "γυναικὸς ἀρετὰς ἀξίως ἐπαινέσαι"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0857.8", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "σοφοῦ τινος γένοιτ’ ἂν ἱστορὸς λόγων."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0857.9", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ΜΗΔΕΙΑ"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0857.10", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": ". . τὸ θρέψαι δ’ ἐν βροτοῖσι πολλάκις"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0857.11", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "πλείω πορίζει φίλτρα τοῦ φύσαι τέκνα."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0858.1", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "γαστρὸς δὲ πειρῶ πᾶσιν ἡμίαν κρατεῖν"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0858.2", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "μόνη γὰρ ὧν πέπονθεν οὐκ ἔχει χάριν,"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0858.3", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ἀεὶ δὲ τοῦ δοθέντος ἐνδείᾳται πλέον."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0858.4", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ὅστις δὲ γαστρὸς μὴ κρατεῖν ἐπίσταται,"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0858.5", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "οὗτος τὰ πλεῖω τῶν κακῶν ἔχει κακά."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0858.7", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "γλώσσης μάλιστα πανταχοῦ πειρῶ κρατεῖν,"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0858.8", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ὅ καὶ γέροντι καὶ νέῳ τιμὴν φέρει"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0858.9", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ἢ γλῶσσα συγὴν καιρίαν κεκτημένη."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0858.10", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "μὴ φθόνει τοῖς εὐτυχοῦσι, μὴ δοκῆς εἶναι κακός."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0858.11", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Stob. Flor. 38, 3: Χάρητος. ‘μὴ φθόνει — κακός’."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0859.1", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Θνητοὶ γενῶτες μὴ φρονεῖθ’ ὑπὲρ θεούς."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0859.2", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Stob. Flor. 22, 16: Δημῶνκτος. ‘Θνητοὶ — θεούς’. φρονεῖτ’ S. cf. Men. mon. 243: θνητὸς πεφυκὼς μὴ φρονῆς ὑπέρθεα."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0859.3", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "κόλαζε κρίναν, ἀλλὰ μὴ θυμούμενος."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0859.4", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Δημῶνκτος. ‘κόλαζε"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0859.5", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ἄνθρωπος ὧν μέμνησο τῆς κοινῆς τύχης."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0859.6", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "φθόνος κάκιστος κάδικώτατος θεός,"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0859.7", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "κακοῖς τε χαίρει κάγαθοῖς ἀλύγνεται."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0859.8", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Ἱπποθόωντος. ‘φθόνος οὐδεὶς ἂν εἴποι πτέ."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0860.1", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ξενχθεὶς γάμοισιν οὐκέτ’ ἔστ’ ἐλεύθερος."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0860.2", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ἀλλ’ ἔν γ’ ἔχει τι χρηστόν· ἐν κήδει γὰρ ὧν"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0860.3", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ἐθελῶ δέδουκε μηδὲν ἐξαμαρτάνειν."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0860.4", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ἀντιγῶ S). ‘ξενχθεὶς — ἐξαμαρτάνειν’. Flor. 67, 14: Ἱπποθόωντος."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0860.5", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "‘ἄριστον ἀνδρὶ κτῆμα συμπαθὴς γυνή’. lemmata sedem mutare"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0860.7", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "παίδων κρατεῖν δεῖ τῶν νεωτέρων σοφούς."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0860.8", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Stob. Flor. 83, 15: Ἱπποθόον. ‘παίδων — σοφούς’."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0860.9", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "γῆρας λεόντων χρείσσον ἀχμαίων νεβρῶν."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0860.10", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Stob. Flor. 115, 14: Ἱπποθόωντος (sic MA, Ἱπποθ S). ‘γῆρας"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0860.11", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "— νεβρῶν’. ἀχμαίων Stobaei A."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0860.12", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "γάμος κράτιστός ἐστιν ἀνδρὶ σόφρῳ"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0860.13", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "τρόπον γυναικὸς χρηστὸν ἐνδον λαμβάνειν·"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0860.14", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "αὕτη γὰρ ἡ προὐξ οἰκίαν σῴζει μόνη."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0860.15", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Stob. Flor. 72, 5: Ἱππώνακτος. ‘γάμος — μόνη’. v. 2 ἐνδον"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0860.16", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "λαμβάνειν Haupt Opusc. 3 p. 637, ἐνδνα λαμβάνειν Bergk Lyr. 2"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0860.17", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ὅστις δὲ τρυφερῶς τὴν γυναῖκ’ ἄγει λαβών,"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0860.18", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "συνεργὸν οὕτος ἀντὶ δεσποίνης ἔχει"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0860.19", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "εὖνουν βεβαίαν εἰς ἀπαντα τὸν βίον,"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0861.1", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "μορφὰς ἀτερπεῖς ὕψεσιν κεκτημένος"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0861.2", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "παρεμφερεῖς ταύταισι τοὺς τρόπους ἔχεις·"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0861.3", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ἐκ τοῦ κακοῦ γὰρ ἡ φύσις τίκτει κακόν,"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0861.4", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ὡς ἐξ ἐχίδνης πάλιν ἐχίδνα γίνεται."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0861.5", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Stob. Flor. 90, 9: Ἰσιδώρου (sic Meineke, ἐμιδώρου MA, εἰσι-"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0861.6", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "δώρου S). `μορφὰς — γίνεται`. v. 3 κακόν] καλόν M. v. 4 γί-"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0861.7", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "θνῆτὸς πεφυκὼς τὰ ὀπίσω πειρῶ βλέπειν."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0861.8", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Stob. Flor. 22, 27: Ἰσιδώρου (sic SM, ἰσιδώρου A). `θνῆτὸς"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0861.9", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "SMA, τἀπίσω Brux., τοὔπισω Men. mon. hinc τοὔπισω μὴ ἔρα βλέ-"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0861.10", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ΝΕΟΠΤΟΛΕΜΟΣ"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0861.11", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "δεινοὶ γὰρ ἄνδρι πάντες ἐσμέν εὐκλεεῖ"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0861.12", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ζῶντι φθονῆσαι, κατθανόντα δ’ αἰνέσαι."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0861.13", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Stob. Flor. 125, 12: Μιμνέρμου ἐκ Νεοπτολέμου (sic MA, μι-"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0861.14", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "μνέρμου nec plura S). `δεινοὶ — αἰνέσαι`. v. 1 κλεινῷ γὰρ — ἐσμέν"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0862.1", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": ". . οἵα δὴ φιλοῦσιν ἰατροὶ λέγειν,"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0862.2", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "τὰ φαῦλα μεῖζω καὶ τὰ δεῖν’ ὑπὲρ φόβον,"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0862.3", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "πυργοῦντες αὐτοὺς"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0862.4", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "καὶ νῦν τὰ δεινὰ ταῦτα καὶ τὰ πόλλ’ ἔπη"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0862.5", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "εἰς ὧδε μικρὸν τεῦχος ἤθροισεν τύχη."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0862.6", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "τί δήτα θνητοὶ πόλλ’ ἀπειλοῦμεν μάτην"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0862.7", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "δεινοὺς ἐπ’ ἀλλήλοισι πέμποντες λόγους,"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0862.8", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "καὶ πάντα συννοοῦμεν ἐκπράξαι χερί,"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0862.9", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "πρόσω βλέποντες; τὴν δὲ πλησίον τύχην"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0862.10", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "οὐκ ἴσμεν οὐδ’ ὁρῶμεν ἀθλίον μόρον."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0862.11", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Clemens Alex. Protr. p. 26: Πατροκλῆς τε ὁ Θούριος καὶ Σοφοκλῆς ὁ νεώτερος ἐν τισὶ τραγωδίαις ἱστορεῖτον τῶν Λιοσκούρων πέρι (vide quae diximus p. 781)."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0863.1", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "δεῦτ’ ὦ τέκν’, ὦ στερχθένθ’ ὅσον πλεῖστον θέμις,"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0863.2", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ὦ πολλὰ τέφραντ’ οὐδὲ λυπήσαντά τι"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0863.3", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "μητέρα, τί προσλάξεσθε κάζαρτάσθέ μου;"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0863.4", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "βούλεσθ’ ἀδύρειν; παίζειτ’, ὦ νέαι φρένες·"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0863.5", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ὡς ἐστιν ὑμῖν τοῦτ’ ἕαρ παντὸς βίου,"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0863.6", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ἥβη δὲ λύπαι φροντίδες θ’ ἥβῶσ’ ὁμοῦ."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0863.7", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Stob. Flor. 78, 7: Πομπηίου Μάχρου (sic S, πομπηίου μακροῦ MA). ‘δεῦτ’ ὦ — ὁμοῦ’. v. 1 ὦ τέκνα ὡστ’ ἐρχθέντα SM. v. 2 τέφραντ’ ex τέφραντά τι corr. S pr. m. v. 3 προσλάξεσθε SMA, προσλάξυσθε cod. Voss. κάζάρτεσθέ μου libri, corr. Valckenaer. v. 4 νέε SMA, νέαι cod. Voss. v. 5 ὑμῖν fortasse cod. Voss., ἡμῖν SMA."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0863.8", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "οὐ τῆς ἐμῆς ἕκατι καρδίας φέρεις"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0863.9", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "λόγους προσηνεῖς, τοῦ δὲ σοῦ κέρδους χάριν."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0863.10", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Stob. Flor. 10, 2: Σεραπίωνος. ‘οὐ — χάριν’."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0863.11", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "κηρύσσεται  ἀρετή· κακὸς δ’ ἄνηρ"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0863.12", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "σιγηλὸν ἔσχε ξῶν τε καὶ θανὼν βίον."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0863.13", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Stob. Flor. 2, 12: Ζηνόδοτου (sic MA, eclogam ignorat S, Ζήνωνος coni. Meineke). ‘κηρύσσεται — βίον’. v. 1 κηρύσσεται ἀεὶ ἀρετή MA, κηρύσσεται μὲν ἡ ’ρετή (debebat ἀρετή) Valckenaer. pro μὲν ego malui γὰρ scribere. v. 2 θανὼν M."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0864.1", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "μηδεις ἀπειρος τῶν ἐμῶν εἰη φίλων"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0864.2", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ἑρωτος, εὐτυχῶν δὲ τὸν θεὸν λάβοι."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0864.3", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "— λάβοι’. v. 2 βροτὸς libri, ἑρωτος coni. Gesner. εὐτυχῶν Gesner,"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0864.4", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "τὸν θεὸν λαβὼν F. G. Schmidt Anal. Soph. p. 49, εὐμενοῦς δὲ τοῦ"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0864.5", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "θεοῦ τύχοι ego malim."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0864.6", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "clides Ponticus. Laert. Diog. 5, 92: φησὶ δ’ Ἀριστόξενος ὁ μουσικὸς"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0864.7", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "καὶ τραγῳδίας αὐτὸν (Heraclidem) ποιεῖν καὶ Θέσπιδος αὐτὰς ἐπι-"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0864.8", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ΠΕΝΘΕΤΣ"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0864.9", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ἔργῳ νόμιζε νεβρίδ’ ἔχειν ἐπενδύτην"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0864.10", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Póllux 7, 45: ὁ ἐπενδύτης ἐστιν ἐν τῇ τῶν πολλῶν χρήσει — καὶ"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0864.11", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Θέσπις δὲ πού φησὶν ἐν τῷ Πενθεῖ ‘ἔργῳ — ἐπενδύτην’. ἔργον"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0864.12", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "νεβρίδος ἔχων ἱερὸν ἐνδυτόν."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0864.13", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "οὐκ ἐξαθρήσας οἶδ’, ἰδὼν δέ σοι λέγω."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0864.14", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ποιητὴς οὕτως ἀπέφρασken ‘οὐκ — λέγω’. ἐξακούσας probabiliter"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0865.1", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ὁρᾶς ὅτι Ζεὺς τῷδε προωτεῦει θεῶν,"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0865.2", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "οὐ ψευδὸς οὐδὲ κόμπον, οὐ μῶρον γέλων"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0865.3", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ἄσκων, τὸ δ᾽ ἥδυ μόνος οὐκ ἐπίσταται."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0865.4", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "παντὶ ᾿ὁρᾶς — ἐπίσταται. v. 3 ἄσκει malim. cum verbis quae se-"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0865.5", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "quuntur cf. Aesch. Prom. 980: τόδε Ζεὺς τοῦπος οὐκ ἐπίσταται."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0865.6", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ἰδε σοι σπένδω κναξξβὶ τὸ λευκὸν"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0865.7", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ἀπὸ θηλαμόνων θλίψας κνακῶν·"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0865.8", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ἰδε σοι μέλιτι χθὐπτὴν τυρὸν"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0865.9", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "μῖξας ἐρυθρῷ κατὰ τῶν σῶν, Πάν"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0865.10", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "δίκερως, τίθεμαι βωμῶν ἀγίων."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0865.11", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ἰδε σοι βρομίου [αἰθοπα] φλεγμὸν λείβω."}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0865.12", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Clemens Alex. Strom. V p. 675: ἐπέψαλλεν δὲ ὡς εἰπεῖν ὁ λαὸς"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0865.13", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "᾿βέδυ ξῶψ χθῶν (leg. χθῶμ) πλήκτρον σφίγξ· κναξξβὶ χθὐπτης φλεγ-"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0865.14", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "μὸς δρώψ᾿. μέμνηται τῆς ἱστορίας καὶ Καλλίμαχος ἐν ἰάμβοις. κναξξβὶ"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0865.15", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "(κναξβὶ L, corr. Sylburg) δὲ κατὰ παραγραφὴν ἢ νόσος παρὰ τὸ"}
{"urn": "mimnermus-tragedy.fragmenta", "edition": "qwen36-nauck-tgf-mimnermus", "locus": "tragicorumgraeco00naucuoft_0865.16", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "κναλεῖν καὶ διαφέρειν (l. διαφθείρειν cum Sylburgio), θύμαί τε"}
